### 5. Payment business failure and compensation : card declined
### Payment method starts with 22222222.
### Expected flow:
### POST /orders
###     OrderCreated -> InventoryReserved -> PaymentRequested -> PaymentFailed
###     -> InventoryReleaseRequested -> InventoryReleased
###      => order status= CANCELLED and inventory reservation status= RELEASED
POST {{orderBaseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: aaaaaaaa-1111-2222-3333-aaaaaaaaaaae

{
  "requestId": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
  "checkoutId": "20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
  "customerId": "30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
  "paymentMethodId": "22222222-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
  "currency": "DKK",
  "totalAmount": 25.00,
  "items": [
    {
      "skuId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "productName": "Demo Product A",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 25.00,
      "itemTotalPrice": 25.00
    }
  ]
}


