### 12. Duplicate SKU lines in one order
### Expected:
###   order-service stores two order_items
###   inventory-service groups quantities by SKU quantities before locking
###   stock reservation uses summed quantity
###   happy path if stock is available
### => Expected final order status: CONFIRMED if enough stock remains
POST {{orderBaseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: aaaaaaaa-1111-2222-3333-aaaaaaaaaabf

